 team, launch pilots, and validate repeatable customer value.</div>\n          <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n\n          <div class=\"stats\">\n            <div class=\"stat\">\n              <div class=\"num\">2 hires</div>\n              <div class=\"label\">Core technical and deployment capacity to support implementation and delivery</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat\">\n              <div class=\"num\">3 pilots</div>\n              <div class=\"label\">Initial health system sites to prove workflow fit and operational pull-through</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat\">\n              <div class=\"num\">18–20 mo.</div>\n              <div class=\"label\">Runway to reach proof points before the next financing decision</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"right-col\">\n          <div class=\"milestone\">\n            <div class=\"band\">\n              <div class=\"band-step\">01</div>\n              <div class=\"band-title\">Build</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"content\">\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"headline\">Stand up the product and deployment muscle required to support real-world pilots</div>\n                <div class=\"detail\">Add the focused team capacity needed to move from founder-driven execution to repeatable implementation.</div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"checklist\">\n                <div class=\"check\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>Hire 2 core team members across engineering / implementation</span></div>\n                <div class=\"check\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>Harden pilot-ready workflows, integrations, and onboarding materials</span></div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"milestone\">\n            <div class=\"band\">\n              <div class=\"band-step\">02</div>\n              <div class=\"band-title\">Deploy</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"content\">\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"headline\">Launch 3 pilot sites and show Designer can be deployed in live clinical settings</div>\n                <div class=\"detail\">Use the round to convert early interest into active installations with measurable operating usage.</div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"checklist\">\n                <div class=\"check\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>Execute pilot launches with named health system partners</span></div>\n                <div class=\"check\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>Demonstrate implementation rhythm that can be repeated across sites</span></div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"milestone\">\n            <div class=\"band\">\n              <div class=\"band-step\">03</div>\n              <div class=\"band-title\">Validate</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"content\">\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"headline\">Generate proof that the product delivers value and supports a repeatable next-stage deployment motion</div>\n                <div class=\"detail\">The objective is not broad scale; it is enough evidence to support the next financing and expansion step with credibility.</div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"checklist\">\n                <div class=\"check\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>Show user adoption and workflow fit across pilot environments</span></div>\n                <div class=\"check\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>Document outcome and operational evidence for follow-on growth capital</span></div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"ribbon-wrap\">\n          <div class=\"ribbon-title\">Use of funds</div>\n          <div class=\"ribbon\">\n            <div class=\"fund\">\n              <div class=\"pct\">45%</div>\n              <div class=\"name\">Team build</div>\n              <div class=\"desc\">2 core hires to expand engineering, implementation, and day-to-day deployment capacity</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fund\">\n              <div class=\"pct\">25%</div>\n              <div class=\"name\">Pilot delivery</div>\n              <div class=\"desc\">Launch support, implementation work, workflow configuration, and customer onboarding</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fund\">\n              <div class=\"pct\">20%</div>\n              <div class=\"name\">Product / data readiness</div>\n              <div class=\"desc\">Integration hardening, infrastructure, security, and production reliability for pilots</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fund\">\n              <div class=\"pct\">10%</div>\n              <div class=\"name\">Operating buffer</div>\n              <div class=\"desc\">Runway protection for a disciplined proof period through validation milestones</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bottom-note\">\n          <div class=\"proof-note\">\n            <span class=\"lead\">This round is designed to fund proof, not scale.</span>\n            <span class=\"muted\"> Capital is tied to a concrete sequence: build the core team, launch pilots, and produce the evidence required for repeatable deployment.</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"safe-chip\">Finite milestone-based raise</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"footer-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n      <img\n        class=\"footer-logo\"\n        src=\"../../../../assets/logo/designer-health-logo-black.svg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n        aria-hidden=\"true\"\n      />\n    </section>\n  </body>\n</html>"
